# Digital Cell Governance Compatibility Adapter

## Purpose

Preserve the former Digital Cell governance reference for auditability while routing active policy through the Codex-first `AGENTS.md` and Authority `.agent/` contract.

## Activation

Consult only when reviewing historical Digital Cell governance or reconciling a project-specific rule with the canonical Authority contract.

## Non-applicability

Do not use this adapter as a competing always-on lifecycle, Mimir, memory, or validation authority.

## Fallback

Use `AGENTS.md`, `COMMANDMENTS_OF_THE_CODE.md`, and `.agents/skills/authority-governance/SKILL.md` for active policy. The pre-migration source is preserved under `.agent/legacy/pre-authority-migration-20260814/cursor-rules/`.

## Control status

This is an advisory compatibility adapter; `AGENTS.md` and the canonical Authority contract are authoritative.
